#: ../../source/guides/user/documents.md:113
msgid ""
"A path with no extension that has never been seen on disk is treated as a"
" *directory*, not as a file to download. That is what lets \"you named a "
"missing directory\" be told apart from \"you named a missing file in a "
"directory that exists\"."
msgstr ""

