msgid "url + a valid PDF path"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/user/documents.md
msgid "that file is used"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/user/documents.md
msgid "url + a directory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/user/documents.md
msgid "url + an invalid path"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/user/documents.md
msgid "**warning**, and the run falls back to the URL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/user/documents.md:126
msgid ""
"With saving off, an unusable path is never fatal: there is a URL to fall "
"back to, and falling back with a warning is more useful than refusing. "
"With saving on there is nothing to fall back to, so the same situation is"
" an error."
msgstr ""

